// OilRig APT Schedule Task Persistence - Security | T1053.005, T1071.004, T1112, T1543.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/OilRig/win_security_apt_oilrig_mar18.yml
winlog.channel:Security AND (event.code:4698 AND (winlog.event_data.TaskName:("SC Scheduled Scan" OR UpdatMachine)))
